    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭarba</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Iarbas</span></b> , or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hĭarbas</span></b> , ae, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a king of
			Mauritania</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 3, 552 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 4,
				36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 5, 45</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭarbī-ta</span></b> ,
				ae, m., <i>a
			Mauritanian</i>, <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 19, 15</span></i>;
			cf. respecting him, Weichert: De Iarbita Timagenis aemulatore,
			Grimm. 1821.</div>
